rn Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1004","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1071","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"120","reputation":"3450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10038","city":"CS1071","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,85,61,51,71,74],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"120","reputation":"3450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18007","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1021205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"跟随孙家征战三代，为东吴开国老将之一。早年随孙坚攻洛阳、襄阳，孙坚死后随孙策平定江东，辅佐孙权。在赤壁之战中主战，并担任先锋曾破蔡瑁、文聘，在赤壁中就黄盖于水中，在濡须口与周泰战平许褚。后随吕蒙等人一同攻克荆州，击败关羽。在刘备后续进军中与陆逊一同抗拒蜀军。","tc":"跟隨孫家征戰三代，為東吳開國老將之一。早年隨孫堅攻洛陽、襄陽，孫堅死后隨孫策平定江東，輔佐孫權。在赤壁之戰中主戰，并擔任先鋒曾破蔡瑁、文聘，在赤壁中就黃蓋于水中，在濡須口與周泰戰平許褚。后隨呂蒙等人一同攻克荊州，擊敗關羽。在劉備后續進軍中與陸遜一同抗拒蜀軍。","en":"He served three generations of the Sun family and was one of the founding veteran generals of Eastern Wu. In his early years, he followed Sun Jian in attacking Luoyang and Xiangyang. After Sun Jian's death, he followed Sun Ce in pacifying Jiangdong and assisted Sun Quan. During the Battle of Red Cliffs, he advocated for war, served as vanguard to defeat Cai Mao and Wen Pin, and rescued Huang Gai from the water. At Ruxukou, he and Zhou Tai fought Xu Chu to a draw. Later, he joined Lu Meng and others in capturing Jing Province and defeating Guan Yu. During Liu Bei's subsequent advance, he resisted the Shu forces alongside Lu Xun.","jp":"孫家三代に従って各地を転戦し、東呉開国の宿将の一人となった。若くして孫堅に従い洛陽や襄陽を攻め、孫堅の死後は孫策に従って江東を平定し、孫権を補佐した。赤壁の戦いでは主戦を主張し、先鋒を務めて蔡瑁や文聘を破り、赤壁では水中に落ちた黄蓋を救出し、濡須口では周泰とともに許褚と引き分けた。のちに呂蒙らに従って荊州を攻略し、関羽を撃破。その後の劉備の進軍に際しては、陸遜とともに蜀軍を防ぎ止めた。","kr":"손씨 가문을 3대에 걸쳐 섬기며 종군한 동오의 개국 노장 중 한 사람이다. 젊은 시절 손견을 따라 낙양과 양양을 공격했고, 손견 사후에는 손책을 따라 강동을 평정하였으며 손권을 보좌했다. 적벽대전에서 주전을 주장하고 선봉을 맡아 채모와 문빙을 격파했으며, 적벽에서는 물에 빠진 황개를 구출하고 유수구에서는 주태와 함께 허저와 맞서 비겼다. 이후 여몽 등과 함께 형주를 함락시키고 관우를 격파했다. 뒤이은 유비의 진군에서는 육손과 함께 촉군을 막아냈다."},"not